// bunx --bun prisma migrate dev --name cex_init
// bunx prisma generate (This gives you the TypeScript auto-complete).
// bunx prisma generate does exactly that. It reads your schema.prisma file
// and generates the TypeScript types and methods (like .create, .findUnique, .upsert)
// so that VS Code can auto-complete them and check them for errors.